WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.134 --> 00:00:14.999
Kip stood up.

2
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:21.048
Snow blew all around him.

3
00:00:21.049 --> 00:00:24.384
"See you later, Bird!" Kip called.

4
00:00:24.385 --> 00:00:27.512
"I'm going to play in the—whoa!"

5
00:00:27.513 --> 00:00:31.465
A strong gust of wind blew.

6
00:00:31.466 --> 00:00:33.828
Kip flew through the air.

7
00:00:33.829 --> 00:00:36.206
He tumbled over and over.

8
00:00:36.207 --> 00:00:39.759
"Ahh!" cried Kip.

9
00:00:39.760 --> 00:00:45.888
Poomf! He landed in a big snowdrift.

10
00:00:45.889 --> 00:00:49.746
Kip pulled himself out of the snow.

11
00:00:49.747 --> 00:00:52.971
Wind blew toward Kip.

12
00:00:52.972 --> 00:00:59.138
Snow swirled around him.

13
00:00:59.139 --> 00:01:03.116
But Kip wanted to play anyway.

14
00:01:03.117 --> 00:01:11.588
"I'll build a snowman," said Kip.

15
00:01:11.589 --> 00:01:15.341
He rolled snow into a ball.

16
00:01:15.342 --> 00:01:18.562
Soon he had a huge snowball.

17
00:01:18.563 --> 00:01:21.328
More snow was falling.

18
00:01:21.329 --> 00:01:27.438
Soon snow covered Kip.

19
00:01:27.439 --> 00:01:29.542
Then more wind blew.

20
00:01:29.543 --> 00:01:32.099
The snowball rolled over Kip.

21
00:01:32.100 --> 00:01:34.662
"Ahh!" he cried.

22
00:01:34.663 --> 00:01:39.667
Kip was stuck to the huge snowball.

23
00:01:39.668 --> 00:01:42.530
The snowball rolled down a hill.

24
00:01:42.531 --> 00:01:46.704
It rolled straight toward the frozen pond.

25
00:01:46.705 --> 00:01:50.444
"Ahh!" cried Kip.
